  "groupId": "main_2",
  "stageId": "main_02-08",
  "title": "不做约定",
  "storyCode": "2-8",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3708c92bcf6c358e711b38297d84c901f79b8711c534c83ae0a4d14eae43f7ac",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_b"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "芙兰卡，雷蛇，注意警戒四周。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我带米莎去见陈长官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们又迟到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别给龙门增加多余的安全隐患。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陈长官，整合运动多次袭击我们的护送队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而现在，敌人仍在我们周围徘徊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里并不安全，请赶快带米莎离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就是米莎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从现在起，你必须听从近卫局的安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "PC94172，看好这孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局队员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟我来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "陈长官，这个孩子，我不知道龙门究竟需要她做什么——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我希望龙门能保护好她的安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龙门对感染者已经很宽厚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但米莎的身体状况并不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我希望龙门在解决事件后，能让米莎在罗德岛生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我会向魏长官申请的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "检查后如果没有其他问题，龙门就会把她移交给罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果，真的没有问题的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用不了太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就在这里暂时告别吧，米莎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛欢迎你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，我不在这段时间里，请你保护贫民区的孩子们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哦，明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没问题！我答应你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我说，米莎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以后可以教我......怎么做娃娃吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呵呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的任务就这样结束了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "牵扯的事情越多，罗德岛越会陷入被动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但龙门还把我们蒙在鼓里呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龙门对我们很冷淡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但整合运动可是十分热情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敌人想要攻击我们所在的街道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然早有耳闻，但龙门的建筑风格，果然很复杂呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明是条街，却建在楼顶....."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完全是让敌人有机可乘嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又是整合运动......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——追到这里来了吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们究竟要米莎......做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
